<title>GHANA: SOCCER-GHANA BEAT ZIMBABWE 2-1 IN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GHANA BEAT ZIMBABWE 2-1 IN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana beat Zimbabwe 2-1 (halftime 2-1) on Sunday in their group one African Nations Cup qualifier.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ghana - Abede Pele 22 Osei Kuffuor 39</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Shepherd Muradzi 24</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
